    <p class="text-center mt-5">Subscribe to our newsletter to get notified whenever we publish a new devlog! You can always unsubscribe at any time from <a class="text-blue-500 underline" href="/unsubscribe">here</a>.</p>
 
    <div class="w-full">
        <SubscribeApi client:load />
    </div>
</div>